        "ggopfDdPmnf_text": "<p>Antione Jones</p>",
        "ggou9D0_ekv_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;\">Nobody talks about this part.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;\">Not the labs.&nbsp;<strong>What it actually feels like day to day when the cortisol loop is gone.</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;\">Around day 12, you're laying down in bed with your wife &nbsp; and you realize you went longer then usual. &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;\"><strong>You didn’t stop mid way to distract yourself&nbsp;</strong> You enjoyed the time and you stayed present.&nbsp;You're just there.&nbsp;</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;\"><strong>That night your wife notices and simply just smiles of joy and satisfaction&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;\">\"You seem different.\"</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;\">\"Different how?\"</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;\">\"Just... present. I don't know.\"</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;\"><strong>That's the moment.</strong> Not a lab result. A real person noticing the version of you that used to show up is back.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;\">The one who didn't need to manage energy. Who came home and was actually there, with something left.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;\"><strong>That's what this fixes. Not a number on a panel. You.</strong></span></p>",
